            "review_title": "Review at Gụ Wine Bistro",
            "review_text": "Quynh M\n622 contributions\n0\nNice experience\nSep 2026 • Friends\nGụ Wine Bistro is a lovely little spot in Da Nang with a cozy and stylish atmosphere. I really enjoyed the food — the flavors were well-balanced and the dishes felt thoughtfully prepared. The atmosphere is definitely one of the highlights: warm, intimate and relaxed, making it a nice place for a dinner or a glass of wine.\n\nI also liked the overall vibe and concept. It feels more personal and relaxed than a typical restaurant, while still having a touch of sophistication.\n\nOverall, a nice dining experience and definitely a place I’d consider coming back to.\n\nHopefully menu changing quite often\nRead more\nWritten September 12, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
