            "review_title": "Review at Gụ Wine Bistro",
            "review_text": "Y&SFOOD!\nBangkok, Thailand1110 contributions\n0\n5 PERFECT DINNERS.\nApr 2026 • Solo\nGU WINE BISTRO - @guwinebistro \napproaches dining with the mentality of a serious wine destination, yet what surprised me most was how confidently the kitchen stands on its own. The atmosphere is relaxed and contemporary, elevated by carefully selected music and a room that encourages lingering rather than rushing through the evening.\n\nWhat gives the place real personality is the unusually broad selection of wines by the glass, assembled with genuine curiosity rather than trend-following. Instead of treating food as support for the cellar, the kitchen operates with equal ambition: flavors are clean, expressive, and thoughtfully composed, delivering a level of cooking that would justify the visit even without the wine program.\n\nService moves naturally between professionalism and informality, helping the experience feel fluid and welcoming rather than staged.\n\nGU WINE BISTRO succeeds because it understands balance — between wine and food, energy and comfort, accessibility and refinement — creating one of Da Nang’s most convincing contemporary dining addresses.\n\n⭐️ NEW ENTRY IN THE Y&SFOOD! DA NANG DINING GUIDE 2026.\nRead more\nWritten May 25, 2026",
